.TH ASN 1 "2026-05-23" "hako" "hako utilities"
.SH NAME
asn \- look up origin ASN information
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B asn
.RI [ @nameserver ]
.I ip|host
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B asn
looks up an IPv4 address or resolves a hostname to its first IPv4 address, then
queries Team Cymru's WHOIS service for the origin ASN, BGP prefix, country code,
registry, allocation date, and AS name.
.PP
The default DNS nameserver for hostname resolution is
.BR 8.8.8.8 .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI @ nameserver
Use
.I nameserver
for hostname resolution.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B "asn 1.1.1.1"
Print ASN information for
.BR 1.1.1.1 .
.TP
.B "asn example.com"
Resolve
.B example.com
and print ASN information for the first IPv4 address.
.TP
.B "asn @1.1.1.1 example.com"
Resolve using
.BR 1.1.1.1 .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The lookup succeeded.
.TP
.B 1
Wrong arguments, DNS failure, WHOIS failure, or malformed WHOIS response.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dig (1),
.BR whois (1),
.BR hako (1)
